PHP bindings to the libssh2 library which provide access to resources
(shell, remote exec, tunneling, file transfer) on a remote machine using a
secure cryptographic transport.

PECL ssh2 for php84 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/ssh2 of the
release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20240924/ssh2.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d, with the
libssh2 of the package az (/usr/local/az/lib).
